# Build-context hygiene for `Dockerfile`: the image builds from tracked sources and its own pnpm install.
# Host install/build output would overlay the image's (symlinks into a host store), and a vessel's keys or
# state must never ride a layer.
.git
.claude
.worktrees
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.pnpm-store
.pronaos-build
wikis
mempalace/tests
mempalace/benchmarks
mempalace/website
mempalace/landing
mempalace/docs
mempalace/uv.lock
packages/lararium-sensorium/fixtures/claude-week-2026-10-07
VSCode-TW5-Syntax
.env
.env.*
**/*.log
**/lares-state
**/.lares
